  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supports grassroots civic initiatives, boosting the potential of emerging civic activists. Enhances opportunities for civil society to enact small-scale positive change, engage Azerbaijani citizens in defending and claiming their rights. Increase the level of coordinated action between legal professionals, civic activists, and influential opinion makers.</narrative>
